  "about": {
    "title": "About the Furious Fists set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Furious Fists is a XY expansion released on 13 August 2014. It has 114 cards: 111 in the main set and 2 secret rares and 1 alternate versions. There are also 97 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 111 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (208 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 211 cards, adding the 2 secret rares and 1 alternate versions).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
